---
import Base from '../templates/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  head={{
    title: "Happy Women's Day, Maayan",
    description:
      "A special page celebrating Maayan on International Women's Day.",
  }}
>
  <main class='mx-auto max-w-screen-lg px-4 py-10'>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class='mb-12 text-center'>
      <div class='mb-4 inline-block'>
        <span class='animate-float text-6xl'>🌸</span>
      </div>
      <h1
        class='mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 via-purple-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-transparent'
      >
        Happy International Women's Day
      </h1>
      <h2 class='mb-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-cyan-300'>
        Celebrating Maayan
      </h2>
      <p class='mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-300'>
        Today we celebrate the strength, wisdom, and brilliance of women
        everywhere—and especially you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Decorative Cards -->
    <div class='mb-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3'>
      <div
        class='group rounded-lg border border-pink-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-900/20 to-slate-800/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-pink-400/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-pink-500/20'
      >
        <div
          class='mb-3 text-4xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110'
        >
          💪
        </div>
        <h3 class='mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-pink-300'>Strength</h3>
        <p class='text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300'>
          Your resilience and determination inspire everyone around you. You
          face challenges with grace and courage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class='group rounded-lg border border-purple-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-900/20 to-slate-800/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-purple-400/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-purple-500/20'
      >
        <div
          class='mb-3 text-4xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110'
        >
          ✨
        </div>
        <h3 class='mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-purple-300'>Brilliance</h3>
        <p class='text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300'>
          Your intelligence and creativity light up every space you enter. You
          bring fresh perspectives and innovative ideas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class='group rounded-lg border border-cyan-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-900/20 to-slate-800/40 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/20'
      >
        <div
          class='mb-3 text-4xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110'
        >
          ❤️
        </div>
        <h3 class='mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-cyan-300'>Heart</h3>
        <p class='text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300'>
          Your kindness and compassion make the world a better place. You lift
          others up and create meaningful connections.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quote Section -->
    <div
      class='border-gradient-to-r relative mb-12 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-slate-800/60 from-pink-500/20 via-purple-500/20 to-cyan-500/20 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm'
    >
      <div
        class='absolute left-0 top-0 h-1 w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 via-purple-500 to-cyan-500'
      >
      </div>
      <blockquote class='text-center'>
        <p class='mb-4 text-xl font-light italic text-slate-200 md:text-2xl'>
          "Here's to strong women: may we know them, may we be them, may we
          raise them."
        </p>
        <footer class='text-sm text-slate-400'>— Unknown</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <!-- What Makes Maayan Special -->
    <div
      class='mb-8 rounded-lg border border-pink-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-900/10 via-purple-900/10 to-cyan-900/10 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm'
    >
      <h3
        class='mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-center text-2xl font-semibold text-transparent'
      >
        What Makes Maayan Amazing
      </h3>
      <div class='mb-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2'>
        <div class='rounded-md border border-pink-500/20 bg-slate-800/30 p-4'>
          <div class='mb-2 flex items-center gap-3'>
            <span class='text-2xl'>🐕🐈🐈🐈</span>
            <h4 class='text-lg font-medium text-pink-300'>
              Pet Parent Extraordinaire
            </h4>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-slate-300'>
            Managing a furry household of one dog and three cats? That takes
            patience, love, and serious organizational skills. Your home must be
            filled with so much personality (and probably a lot of entertaining
            chaos)!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-md border border-cyan-500/20 bg-slate-800/30 p-4'>
          <div class='mb-2 flex items-center gap-3'>
            <span class='text-2xl'>🎮</span>
            <h4 class='text-lg font-medium text-cyan-300'>
              Counter-Strike Champion
            </h4>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-slate-300'>
            Your CS2 skills are legendary! Whether you're clutching rounds or
            calling strategies, you bring precision, quick thinking, and
            competitive fire to every match. Respect to a true gamer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-md border border-purple-500/20 bg-slate-800/30 p-4'>
          <div class='mb-2 flex items-center gap-3'>
            <span class='text-2xl'>🥧</span>
            <h4 class='text-lg font-medium text-purple-300'>
              Crack Pie Connoisseur
            </h4>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-slate-300'>
            A woman who knows that crack pie is one of life's greatest
            pleasures? Impeccable taste. That sweet, salty, buttery perfection
            is the dessert of champions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-md border border-rose-500/20 bg-slate-800/30 p-4'>
          <div class='mb-2 flex items-center gap-3'>
            <span class='text-2xl'>🌹</span>
            <h4 class='text-lg font-medium text-rose-300'>Beautifully You</h4>
          </div>
          <p class='text-sm text-slate-300'>
            Like roses, you bring beauty and strength together. You're someone
            who can be both fierce on the battlefield and gentle with your
            pets—that's the real definition of grace.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Personal Message -->
    <div
      class='relative mb-12 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-rose-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-900/10 via-pink-900/10 to-purple-900/10 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm'
    >
      <div class='absolute -right-4 -top-4 text-6xl opacity-10'>🌹</div>
      <div class='absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 text-6xl opacity-10'>🌹</div>
      <h3
        class='mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-400 via-pink-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-center text-2xl font-semibold text-transparent'
      >
        A Message for Maayan
      </h3>
      <div class='prose prose-pink prose-invert relative z-10 max-w-none'>
        <p class='mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-300'>
          On this International Women's Day, I want to take a moment to
          celebrate everything that makes you extraordinary. Your strength, your
          wisdom, your kindness—these qualities don't just define you; they
          inspire everyone fortunate enough to know you.
        </p>
        <p class='mb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-300'>
          You have a unique ability to bring light into every situation, to find
          solutions where others see only problems, and to make people feel
          valued and heard. Whether you're dominating in Counter-Strike, caring
          for your beloved pets, or sharing your love of crack pie with friends,
          you approach life with passion and authenticity.
        </p>
        <p class='leading-relaxed text-slate-300'>
          Keep being the amazing person you are. The world needs more people
          like you—people who lead with both mind and heart, who stand up for
          what's right, and who never stop growing and learning. Here's to you,
          Maayan! 🌹
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Floating Flowers Animation -->
    <div class='py-8 text-center'>
      <div class='inline-flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-4xl'>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 0s'>🌹</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 0.2s'>🌸</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 0.4s'>🌹</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 0.6s'>🌺</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 0.8s'>🌹</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 1.0s'>🌷</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 1.2s'>🌹</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 1.4s'>💐</span>
        <span class='animate-float' style='animation-delay: 1.6s'>🌹</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Message -->
    <div class='mt-12 text-center'>
      <p
        class='bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-400 via-purple-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-lg font-medium text-transparent'
      >
        Wishing you a wonderful Women's Day, Maayan! 🎉
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style>
    @keyframes float {
      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0px);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-20px);
      }
    }

    .animate-float {
      display: inline-block;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    /* Gradient border animation */
    @keyframes gradient-shift {
      0% {
        background-position: 0% 50%;
      }
      50% {
        background-position: 100% 50%;
      }
      100% {
        background-position: 0% 50%;
      }
    }

    .prose p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    /* Smooth hover transitions */
    .group:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
  </style>
</Base>
